 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Di9bDQ6pdPIQ7kNvwFbqwhg&_nc_oc=AdpeXmbiy69Gn9_ZbYhT0YGuMfTmY5evRP8KVb_MD51twOPWVg3OYLrtLq8QCIY8srg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMta_Wp_LLKNMAxWl0eo4DVjFWSYZ_I33WZ9NqDBvC51A&oe=6AD0EEC1"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_dBrYa7sgOYQ7kNvwFxJ6Sz&_nc_oc=AdpU6UvzwGctjS3UIB9B1BkYEnGgwgP5zNiogUYbOpYpqmzb-lli-m28KuE10HyyuVw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNFD2fzUYwVEDZjhQUXBjfebAHZpeaG7xOCNATTC9RHVQ&oe=6AD0FC26"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7pdp3CEFfIwQ7kNvwHPTLCv&_nc_oc=AdrCQ42o7sVAj8pGyhlX6gIkAe-dQ0-gv7jV6JUii0_H6wSIRcIq5oNSKiKOJIE444Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQP4S8CzCm66fqV-A4JPDPiExhqyew6yVz5jP_BIOnJT_A&oe=6AD1061C"}, {"fil